X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p><strong>Overview:</strong><br>The Authentic
  Leadership Self-Assessment is a reflective tool that helps people evaluat
 e their authentic leadership skills by evaluating leadership across four k
 ey dimensions: self-awareness\, internalized moral perspective\, balanced 
 processing\, and relational transparency. This tool provides insights into
  your leadership strengths and areas for growth\, fostering greater alignm
 ent with your core values and enabling you to develop trust\, ethical deci
 sion-making\, and effective leadership practices.<br><br></p>\n<p><strong>
 Instructions:</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Complete the Authentic Leade
 rship Self-Assessment</strong> questionnaire and upload it on canvas. <a i
 d="258538" class="instructure_file_link instructure_scribd_file inline_dis
 abled" href="https://alueducation.instructure.com/courses/2727/files/51367
 5?wrap=1" target="_blank" data-canvas-previewable="true" data-api-endpoint
 ="https://alueducation.instructure.com/api/v1/courses/2727/files/513675" d
 ata-api-returntype="File">Download it here</a></li>\n<li><strong>Read the 
 chapter on Authentic Leadership </strong>available in Perusall to understa
 nd the four dimensions in depth.</li>\n<li>Respond to the following prompt
  and<strong> upload your responses along with your Self-Assessment documen
 t:</strong></li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>Prompt (1 Page Response)</strong></p>\
 n<ol style="list-style-type: decimal\;">\n<li>Based on your assessment res
 ults and the chapter reading\, reflect on the dimension in which you score
 d the highest and share with examples how this has served as a strength fo
 r you as an emerging leader.&nbsp\;</li>\n<li>Reflect on the dimension in 
 which you scored the lowest\, how has this affected your effectiveness as 
 an emerging leader? (share real examples).&nbsp\;</li>\n</ol>
