DESCRIPTION:Summative Assignment: Strategic Cost Management and Performance
  Improvement \n\nThis managerial accounting project presentation aims to 
 provide you with an in-depth understanding of strategic cost management pr
 inciples and their application in improving organisational performance. Ov
 er the course of four weeks\, You have  worked on analysing cost structur
 es\, identifying cost drivers\, implementing cost reduction strategies\, a
 nd evaluating performance metrics to enhance decision-making capabilities 
 within Cape Eco Furniture Co\n\nObjective: The major purpose is for you to
  present findings\, recommendations\, and implementation plans to stakehol
 ders including senior management \n\n Instructions \n\n* Present your f
 indings and recommendations to the board of  Cape Eco Furniture Co\n\nYou
 r presentation should include the following\n\n* Cape Eco Furniture Co's b
 ackground\,  business model\, products/services offered\, market position
 \, and financial performance.\n\n* Issues presented by the Cape Eco Furnit
 ure Co. board\n\n* Cost analysis and potential areas for cost reduction an
 d efficiency improvement within Cape Eco Furniture Co's operations.\n\n* C
 ost reduction strategies that can be used by Cape Eco Furniture Co to redu
 ce the costs\n\n* Feasibility and potential impact of proposed initiatives
  on the Cape Eco Furniture Co's long-term success.\n\n* Performance metric
 s and KPIs to monitor the effectiveness of cost reduction efforts.\n\n* Re
 commendations for Cape Eco Furniture Co growth \n\n* Conclusion \n\n* Re
 ferences \n\nSubmission \n\n* Slide deck maximum of 12 slides  includin
 g all the aspects of the project as discussed above.\n\n* Video recording 
 of between 8-9 minutes max involving all team members explaining the slide
 s\n\nSubmission type: PDF file\n\n[Click here to view submission Rubric] (
 https://docs.google.com/document/d/1LqUMViZ0AGA7ZR9oUtcPEEkiQo6uIbim5YEzzT
 -rrf0/edit)
